      "mergedPostDetails": "Selecting looks in the Main menu feels the same as selecting an avatar from your own, or from favorites. Its just a new button to select what avatar you want.\n\nFor the action menu look quick select it feels like a expression toggle. So just like you were able to quickly apply a look it feels like you should have a way to also quickly turn off that look. \n\nSome ideas that come to mind. \n\n1. Having a indicator to show what look is active just like an avatar toggle. clicking it again could switch back to previous avatar or the base avatar the look uses.\n\n2. Have an additional button that you can click that revers back like the previous example.\n\n3. Change it to a avatar select menu that you can customize. could put personal, or favorite avatars in there to quickly select them. instead of only looks.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Action menu look selection [Feedback]",
