  "details": "# Issue:\n\nCurrently, getting back to the default look of your Avatar is quite complicated, as you have to:\n\n1. Switch to a different Avatar\n\n2. Switch back to your original Avatar\n\nWhile selecting your current Avatar in the Avatars Menu shows \"Avatar changed to {Avatar Name}\", but nothing actually happens.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nAdd a \"Default Look\" look to the beginning the \"Looks\" section of the Avatar Main Menu as well as the Action Menu. This would allow users to easily switch back to their default look without first having to figure out how to do that.",
